# Move a planning group to one of its named SRDF poses.
#
# Named targets only. A free-form joint or pose goal belongs to MoveIt's own interfaces; this
# exists so the behavior tree can say "tucked" without carrying fourteen joint values in XML.

# A group in g1.srdf: left_arm, right_arm, both_arms, left_hand or right_hand.
string group
# A group_state defined for that group. Rejected if the SRDF does not have it, so a typo in a
# tree fails at the goal rather than silently holding position.
string named_target
---
bool success
string message
---
# No feedback field: the move either completes or fails, and "still executing" is not information
# the caller can act on.
